This package contains the alpha source release of Anteater Chess,
including source code, tests, build scripts, and documentation.
It is an early preview release and some optional or advanced features
may still be incomplete.

Directory overview:
- src/
  Source files
- include/
  Header files
- tests/
  Unit tests
- bin/
  Build output directory for the executable, runtime logs, and test binaries
- build/
  Build intermediates and source-package staging area
- doc/
  Release documentation when included

Supported Makefile targets:
- make / make all
  Build bin/chess and create bin/logs
- make test
  Build and run the maintained test suite
- make clean
  Remove generated build artifacts while preserving the bin/ directory layout
- make tar
  Generate Chess_Alpha_src.tar.gz

After building, run the program with:
   ./bin/chess

Build outputs:
- bin/chess
  Main executable
- bin/logs/
  Runtime log directory
- bin/tests/
  Test binaries and test temporary files

For detailed user and architecture documentation, please refer to the
files placed in doc/ when they are included in the release package.
